  "description": "The emotion expressed is humor, conveyed through the juxtaposition of the serious message about racial bias with the lighthearted, absurd suggestion that a tan skin tone might be the reason for judgment. The visual of a relaxed woman sunbathing on a cliff overlooking Rio de Janeiro reinforces the comedic deflection, implying that tanning is a simple, non-racial explanation for skin color. This creates a tone of ironic or sarcastic humor, which is central to the meme’s intent.",
